  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.1: Added MiddlewareCaptureMode enum (None/Applicable/Executed) replacing the CaptureMiddlewareDetails bool; request spans now emit request_middleware.* tags; MiddlewareExecutionContext tracks executed vs conditionally-skipped middleware at runtime; MediatorCodeWriter static blocks refactored to raw string literals for readability.",
